=== ATS-301 / D2: the local build gate vs the CI workflow ===

CONDITIONS:
  commit : 47e435331d5ae959034ca9995639855523d26415
  node   : v24.19.0
  date   : 2026-11-05T15:52:03Z

WHAT THIS CHECKS:
  tools/ci_build_gate.mjs claims in its header to run EXACTLY the
  steps that .github/workflows/ats-102-build.yml runs. The 3rd review
  found the claim no longer held: the workflow had gained the
  'Run the ATS-301 gate' step and the local gate had not.

  A comment cannot fail, so the claim is now CHECKED: this mode reads
  the workflow file and compares every 'run:' command with the
  commands the local gate issues, in both directions.

COMMAND: node tools/ci_build_gate.mjs --check-parity

